B.NI=new A.aY(B.aR,["The only way to be a champion is by going through these forced reps and the torture and pain.","Arnold Schwarzenegger"],t.l)
B.O_=new A.aY(B.aR,["Discipline is doing what needs to be done, even if you don't want to do it.","Unknown"],t.l)
B.NR=new A.aY(B.aR,["There is no such thing as talent. There is only effort.","Unknown"],t.l)
B.NL=new A.aY(B.aR,["Success isn't always about greatness. It's about consistency. Consistent hard work gains success. Greatness will come.","Dwayne Johnson"],t.l)
B.NW=new A.aY(B.aR,["The clock is ticking. Are you becoming the person you want to be?","Greg Plitt"],t.l)
B.NM=new A.aY(B.aR,["The last three or four reps is what makes the muscle grow. This area of pain divides the champion from someone else who is not a champion.","Arnold Schwarzenegger"],t.l)
B.NQ=new A.aY(B.aR,["If you want something you've never had, you must be willing to do something you've never done.","Thomas Jefferson"],t.l)
B.NN=new A.aY(B.aR,["Pain is temporary. It may last a minute, or an hour, or a day, or a year, but eventually it will subside and something else will take its place. If I quit, however, it lasts forever.","Eric Thomas"],t.l)
B.NP=new A.aY(B.aR,["Don't stop when you're tired. Stop when you're done.","David Goggins"],t.l)
B.NX=new A.aY(B.aR,["Your mind is the limit. As long as the mind can envision the fact that you can do something, you can do it, as long as you really believe it 100 percent.","Arnold Schwarzenegger"],t.l)
B.NO=new A.aY(B.aR,["Everybody wants to be a bodybuilder, but nobody wants to lift no heavy-ass weights.","Ronnie Coleman"],t.l)
B.NY=new A.aY(B.aR,["Lightweight, baby!","Ronnie Coleman"],t.l)
B.NK=new A.aY(B.aR,["The resistance that you fight physically in the gym and the resistance that you fight in life can only build a strong character.","Arnold Schwarzenegger"],t.l)
B.NS=new A.aY(B.aR,["Being negative and lazy is a disease that leads to depression, insecurity, frustration, and eventual self-destruction.","Phil Heath"],t.l)
B.NJ=new A.aY(B.aR,["To be a champion, you must act like a champion.","Lou Ferrigno"],t.l)
B.NU=new A.aY(B.aR,["Train insane or remain the same.","Unknown"],t.l)
B.NT=new A.aY(B.aR,["Suffer the pain of discipline or suffer the pain of regret.","Unknown"],t.l)
B.NV=new A.aY(B.aR,["Character is who you are when no one is watching.","Unknown"],t.l)
B.NZ=new A.aY(B.aR,["Results require time, sweat, and sacrifice.","Unknown"],t.l)
